{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51942","headline":"西灵观（在新喻县西五十里瑞仙山下，晋永和八年许真君建。） · 吕岩","name":"西灵观（在新喻县西五十里瑞仙山下，晋永和八年许真君建。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八月秋高气渐清，再携琴剑宿西灵。\n蕊珠新换当年殿，函谷重开往日经。\n晋代宰王香馥馥，周朝柱史烛荧荧。\n一声鹤唳人间晓，吟起晴空彻杳冥。\n（隆庆《临江府志》十三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51942.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51942","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}